5874..5950 Comment "/// Function extensionality from a homotopy, through the path space: the map"
5951..6025 Comment "/// takes a point to both functions\' results there and the homotopy\'s path"
6026..6102 Comment "/// between them. Its first end reads the first result, a returned call, and"
6103..6177 Comment "/// a returned call is the call it holds, so the end is `f`; the second is"
6178..6186 Comment "/// `g`."
